config BR2_PACKAGE_ROCKNIX_EXTRA_FIRMWARE
	bool "rocknix-extra-firmware"
	help
	  The RG DS Plus's speaker amplifiers' configuration (aw88166_acf.bin): the AW88166 driver keeps the amplifiers
	  off until it has loaded it. From ROCKNIX's extra-firmware, at the commit ROCKNIX pins.
	  On the AYN Thor: its audio and compute DSPs' firmware, the amplifiers' tuning, the sound topology and the
	  WCN7850's Wi-Fi files (ROCKNIX's SM8550 folder).
